### ⚡ Highlights

- [gabzieg/atmosfera](https://github.com/gabzieg/atmosfera) - Android live wallpaper that reacts to real-time weather (Open-Meteo) via a custom Canvas particle engine and Jetpack Compose companion app.
- [gabzieg/SubTrack](https://github.com/gabzieg/SubTrack) - Privacy-first subscription tracker built with Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP) and Jetpack Compose, featuring local CSV import, SQLDelight, and smart renewal alerts.
- [gabzieg/BroPilot](https://github.com/gabzieg/BroPilot) - Real-time AI co-pilot for Baldur's Gate 3 combining save-file parsing (.lsv), computer vision (OCR), and a Medallion RAG pipeline for build and combat optimization.
- [gabzieg/ai-usage-menu](https://github.com/gabzieg/ai-usage-menu) - Native macOS menu bar utility for monitoring Codex, Claude, and Gemini usage limits in real time.
- [gabzieg/ReadAfter](https://github.com/gabzieg/ReadAfter) - Full-stack mobile application (FastAPI + React Native/Expo) to download, process, and analyze social media videos using AI APIs.

